#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:483
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Re-does</action> the last <quote>object</quote> placement. This menu "
"option is active only if you have previously used <guilabel>Undo</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"<action>Ponavlja</action> zadnju <quote>objekatsku</quote> poziciju. Ova "
"mogućnost izbornika je aktivna samo ako je prethodno korišteno "
"<guilabel>Vrati</guilabel>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:490
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Uredi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Kopiraj</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:497
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Copy</action> the <quote>playground</quote> area to the clipboard."
msgstr "<action>Kopiraj</action> <quote>igralište</quote> područje na tablu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:506
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Playground</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "<guimenu>Igralište</guimenu> Izbornik"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:511
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Playground</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Lock Aspect Ratio</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Igralište</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Omjer zaključanih djelova</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:515
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option preserves the playground aspect ratio when resizing the "
"&ktuberling; window. When the playground aspect ratio does not match the one "
"of the window the background is filled with the one specified in the theme."
msgstr ""
"Ova mogućnost čuva omjer dijelova igrališta  pri promjeni veličine "
"&ktuberling; prozora. Kada se omjer dijelova igrališta ne bude poklapao sa "
"jednim od prozora tada je pozadina popunjena sa jednim određenim prozorom "
"naznačenom u temi."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:522
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Playground</guimenu> <guimenuitem><replaceable>Playground Name</"
"replaceable></guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Igralište</guimenu> <guimenuitem><replaceable>Ime Igrališta</"
"replaceable></guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:526
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Switches to the playground</action>."
msgstr "<action>Mjenja na igralište</action>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:532
#, no-c-format
msgid "It will contain the playgrounds installed in your system."
msgstr "Ono će sadržati instalirano igralište na vašem sistemu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:535
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ktuberling; remembers the last chosen playground the next time it starts up."
msgstr ""
"&ktuberling; se sjeća zadnjeg odabranog igrališta pri narednom paljenju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:541
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Speech</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "The <guimenu>Govor</guimenu> Izbornik"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:551
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Speech</guimenu> <guimenuitem>No Sound</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Govor</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Bez Zvuka</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:555
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Toggles sound off</action>."
msgstr "<action>Isključuje zvuk</action>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:559
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Speech</guimenu> <guimenuitem><replaceable>Language Name</"
"replaceable></guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Govor</guimenu> <guimenuitem><replaceable>Ime Jezika</replaceable></"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:563
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Toggles sound on and speaks the selected language</action>."
msgstr "<action>Pali zvuk te govori izabrani jezik</action>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:569
#, no-c-format
msgid "&ktuberling; remembers of this option the next time it starts up."
msgstr "&ktuberling; se sjeća ve mogućnosti naredni put pri paljenju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:576
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> Meni"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:581
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings Menu"
msgstr "Meni za Postavke"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:587
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>F</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Full Screen "
"Mode</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>F</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Puni Zaslon</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:594
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Toggles the Full Screen mode</action> on and off."
msgstr "<action>Puni Zaslon</action> je uključen i isključen."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:600
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &ktuberling; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"and <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the "
"sections about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings"
"\">Settings Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-"
"help\">Help Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno &ktuberling; ima obične &kde; <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> i "
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> stavki izbornika, za više informacija pročitajte "
"dio o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Izbornik za "
"Postavke</ulink> i <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help"
"\">Izbornik za Pomoć</ulink> iz &kde; Osnove.."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:613
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Česta Pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:617
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim promijeniti izgled igre. Mogu li to uraditi?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:618
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes you can. Refer to <link linkend=\"theme_change\">this</link> section of "
"'Interface Overview' for details."
msgstr ""
"Da, možete. Pogledajte <link linkend=\"theme_change\">this</link> dio  "
"'Pregled Izgleda' za detalje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:621
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play this game?"
msgstr "Mogu li koristiti tastature da igram ovu igru?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:622
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. This game cannot be played using keyboard."
msgstr "Ne. Ovu igru ne možetee igrati sa tastaturom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:625
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have made a great picture and I want to share it with my friends. Can I "
"save it as an image?"
msgstr ""
"Napravio sam odličnu sliku i želim je podijliti sa mojim prijeteljima. Mogu "
"li je snimiti kao sliku?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:626
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To save the current session as an image refer to <link linkend=\"game-"
"save-as-picture\">this</link> section of 'Interface Overview' for details."
msgstr ""
"Da. Da bi ste snimili trenutnu sesiju kao sliku otiđite na <link linkend="
"\"game-save-as-picture\">this</link> dio o 'Pregledu Izgleda' za detalje."

